<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Delhi to Vadodara | Express Container Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a car shipped from Delhi to Vadodara?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door transit time for a car moving from Delhi to Vadodara is 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions, weather, and any scheduled stops for driver rest. Our dedicated carrier follows a pre‑planned itinerary on NH‑19, ensuring minimal delays while maintaining strict safety standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my vehicle insured during the journey and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every vehicle transported on our hydraulic ramp carriers is covered by a 100 percent declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities throughout the entire route. A copy of the insurance certificate is shared with the client before loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car in real time while it’s on the road?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each carrier is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You can view the exact position of your vehicle, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations in real time. Alerts are also sent via SMS and email for key milestones such as loading, departure, and delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide before the car is loaded?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The essential paperwork includes the original Registration Certificate (RC), a valid insurance copy, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed transport agreement, and a GST invoice if the shipment is for a corporate client. For Delhi‑to‑Vadodara moves we also assist with the No‑Objection Certificate (NOC) required by the destination RTO.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are different vehicle types (sedan, SUV, classic) accommodated on the hydraulic ramp carrier?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet features modular hydraulic ramp trailers with adjustable deck heights and reinforced tie‑down points. Sedans and hatchbacks are loaded using standard wheel chocks, while SUVs and larger vehicles receive additional side‑wall braces. Classic or high‑value cars are placed on custom‑cut wooden crates with extra foam padding to guarantee zero‑scratch delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the final cost of car transport from Delhi to Vadodara?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Cost is driven by vehicle size and weight, distance (approximately 1,057 km), fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special handling requirements such as extra padding or expedited service. Seasonal demand and toll variations can also affect pricing, but our transparent cost matrix breaks each component down for full clarity.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
